 Spa which are energy-dependent circuits. In Belgium he was furious after he lacked electrical energy when exiting turn one on the opening lap. It left him vulnerable to the chasing pack, notably the Ferraris which swept past and he entered Les Combes corner alongside Lewis Hamilton, who clipped the Mercedes, <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/jul/19/kimi-antonelli-f1-title-grip-belgian-grand-prix-george-russell-formula-one">sending Russell out of the race</a>.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/jul/23/george-russell-mercedes-engine-problem-formula-one-hungarian-grand-prix">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;r9W3BV8gNX79RYrcLv62E5VViAXkQW1Rtdji2toRT5Mƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;9e5ek-CsC8kA6Ss8I0uPGF183EOSJWGtE1ipGCQjtf0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;RfbB9Bk3Knc4dIVR_HS35dNSRi947XIISVxx23i8nlEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DcLq1trdbCsZ5eQeTOS8VNFQE27lR0tiJi75vjKUm5gƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4JIIcRTWk-YSF2lVd5xfVlFOeQ9lCWvtrJi8RuZQPt8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wapMMU93y9sN7PBLeNVLxlEmW4pI29OEWujrz6fo3Hsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EdHrtebFAzyIGAdbMZLYp_gBG5jrj519RGp_uNq00fIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;schyd4wkubKnqp2VDh1TTAPwmY-BRiFGIYVyyXbGXYUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒer